flowchart TB
  subgraph Field[Physical / simulation layer]
    Sensors[IR · ultrasonic · reed switch]
    RFID[RC522 RFID reader]
    ESP[ESP32 or local device simulator]
    Actuator[Servo · LEDs · buzzer]
    Sensors --> ESP
    RFID --> ESP
    ESP --> Actuator
  end
  subgraph Service[Full-stack service layer]
    API[Authenticated IoT REST API]
    Gate[Gate state machine and command queue]
    Auth[Role-based session and device authentication]
    DB[(MySQL / Drizzle)]
    API --> Gate
    Gate --> DB
    Auth --> API
  end
  subgraph Operations[Operations layer]
    Live[WebSocket update channel]
    UI[React monitoring dashboard]
    Analytics[Audit logs and analytics]
    DB --> Live
    DB --> Analytics
    Live --> UI
    Analytics --> UI
  end
  ESP -->|Events and heartbeat| API
  API -->|Queued commands| ESP
  UI -->|Operator commands| Gate
